WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.118
System architecture.

00:00:02.068 --> 00:00:04.659
How institutional capture works.

00:00:04.659 --> 00:00:06.363
This is the map.

00:00:06.363 --> 00:00:12.818
Thirteen interconnected layers, each documented from official government records, court decisions, and published data.

00:00:12.818 --> 00:00:15.556
No single layer is a conspiracy.

00:00:15.556 --> 00:00:18.738
Each is a documented institutional reality.

00:00:18.738 --> 00:00:28.886
Together, they form a system where power is exercised without accountability, wealth is transferred from labour to capital, and every citizen is financially invested in the system's continuation.

00:00:28.886 --> 00:00:33.409
Start at the top: global financial networks produce political leadership.

00:00:33.409 --> 00:00:36.761
That leadership degrades domestic institutions.

00:00:36.761 --> 00:00:40.397
The degraded institutions cannot hold power accountable.

00:00:40.397 --> 00:00:44.352
The media that should report on this is funded by the government it covers.

00:00:44.352 --> 00:00:47.249
The tax system transfers wealth upward.

00:00:47.249 --> 00:00:50.795
The pension system captures every citizen financially.

00:00:50.795 --> 00:00:54.704
And the immigration system imports labour to sustain the machine.

00:00:54.704 --> 00:00:57.318
Every layer is a link in this chain.

00:00:57.318 --> 00:01:00.568
Remove any one layer and the system adapts.

00:01:00.568 --> 00:01:04.943
This is why reform fails: the architecture is self-reinforcing.

00:01:04.943 --> 00:01:08.079
The thirteen layers of institutional capture.

00:01:08.079 --> 00:01:11.897
Read from top to bottom to understand how the system works.

00:01:11.897 --> 00:01:14.045
The self-reinforcing loop.

00:01:14.045 --> 00:01:19.102
This architecture is self-reinforcing because each layer protects every other layer.

00:01:19.102 --> 00:01:23.852
Global financial networks produce leaders who degrade military independence.

00:01:23.852 --> 00:01:26.238
Courts can't stop them in time.

00:01:26.238 --> 00:01:29.715
Crown corporations operate outside oversight.

00:01:29.715 --> 00:01:32.170
Regulators serve industry.

00:01:32.170 --> 00:01:34.931
Healthcare and housing are privatized.

00:01:34.931 --> 00:01:37.022
Media is captured.

00:01:37.022 --> 00:01:40.136
Pensions make everyone financially dependent.

00:01:40.136 --> 00:01:42.863
Parliament uses privilege as a shield.

00:01:42.863 --> 00:01:45.761
The tax system transfers wealth upward.

00:01:45.761 --> 00:01:48.056
Immigration imports labour.

00:01:48.056 --> 00:01:52.068
And the oversight bodies that should stop all of this cannot enforce.

00:01:52.068 --> 00:01:55.318
Remove any one layer and the system adapts.

00:01:55.318 --> 00:01:59.749
Reform one institution and the remaining twelve protect the status quo.

00:01:59.749 --> 00:02:05.022
This is why forty years of reform has produced zero change in accountability outcomes.

00:02:05.022 --> 00:02:07.988
The system is designed to resist reform.

00:02:07.988 --> 00:02:10.943
That is what institutional capture means.

00:02:10.943 --> 00:02:12.920
connected-intelligence
